41393::$$$message_0291_0000_0000$$$::"This is the eighth Master,[br]Bazett Fraga McRemitz."::
41394::$$$message_0291_0001_0000$$$::"She's so handsome. The very picture of a cross-dressing beauty."::
41395::$$$message_0291_0002_0000$$$::"Yeah. But there are parts about her that are more glamorous than you, in a way."::
41396::$$$message_0291_0003_0000$$$::"What parts...?[lr]::
41397::$$$message_0291_0003_0001$$$::As a Master, I'd like you to pay more attention to my effort (skill) and talent (magical energy), and bluffing. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Not my parts!"::

